; Spelled words marked. Cards pass through except words' letters (1 to 27, apostrophes 27), which are held in
; cells 73-85 until the word's end card says which word it is: a word to be spelled (-11) goes out as its letters
; without the apostrophes, each as 100 + code and the last as 200 + code, then -11; any other word (-10) as it was,
; then -10. Letters past the 13th are dropped (the rules take words of 13 letters at most).
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   c        03-26: a letter is held, and the last one that isn't an apostrophe noted
  04                    CLA   c
  05                    SUB   00
  06                    TAC   end
  07                    CLA   n
  08                    SUB   n13
  09                    TAC   st
  10                    JMP   rec
  11            st      CLA   s70
  12                    ADD   n
  13                    STO   wr
  14                    CLA   c
  15            wr      DATA  0        (STO 73 + n)
  16                    CLA   n
  17                    ADD   00
  18                    STO   n
  19                    CLA   c
  20                    SUB   c27
  21                    TAC   lt
  22                    JMP   rec
  23            lt      CLA   n
  24                    STO   last
  25                    JMP   rec
  26            end     CLA   z        26-63: the word's end: spelled (-11) or not, then its letters and the card
  27                    STO   add
  28                    CLA   c
  29                    ADD   n10
  30                    TAC   sp
  31                    JMP   go
  32            sp      CLA   c100
  33                    STO   add
  34            go      CLA   z
  35                    STO   i
  36            lp      CLA   i
  37                    SUB   n
  38                    TAC   body
  39                    JMP   fin
  40            body    CLA   c70
  41                    ADD   i
  42                    STO   rd
  43            rd      DATA  0        (CLA 73 + i)
  44                    STO   x
  45                    CLA   add
  46                    SUB   00
  47                    TAC   put
  48                    CLA   x
  49                    SUB   c27
  50                    TAC   mark
  51                    JMP   nx
  52            mark    CLA   i
  53                    ADD   00
  54                    SUB   last
  55                    TAC   m1
  56                    CLA   x
  57                    ADD   add
  58                    ADD   add
  59                    STO   x
  60                    JMP   put
  61            m1      CLA   x
  62                    ADD   add
  63                    STO   x
  64            put     OUT   x
  65            nx      CLA   i
  66                    ADD   00
  67                    STO   i
  68                    JMP   lp
  69            fin     OUT   c
  70                    CLA   z
  71                    STO   n
  72                    JMP   rec
  86            n       DATA  0
  87            last    DATA  0
  88            c       DATA  0
  89            x       DATA  0
  90            i       DATA  0
  91            add     DATA  0
  92            z       DATA  0
  93            n13     DATA  13
  94            c27     DATA  27
  95            n10     DATA  10
  96            c100    DATA  100
  97            s70     STO   73
  98            c70     CLA   73
